From 457b3b0f6e78100ad2fba1f9f5258561c56d3158 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 20:21:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] WIP: pointed mountains, reshaping the rounded tops
 (unfinished)

Stopped before it was finished (weekly usage limit). Compiles; not
measured, not checked in game. Edits MountainRelief and TerrainModel:
inland fjord trough profile, stronger and finer gullies on convex tops,
crags and ledges, and a lake check against shores graded down steep
mountain sides. DomeSurvey (previous commits) measures roundness.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01P4U2ge3L4SazHBdDSoJUZ9
